           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/net/" title="View all posts in .Net" rel="category tag">.Net</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/ioc/" title="View all posts in IoC" rel="category tag">IoC</a>, <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/windsor/" title="View all posts in Windsor" rel="category tag">Windsor</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2009/10/strategy-pattern-with-castle-windsor/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Strategy Pattern with Castle Windsor"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="751 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2009/10/strategy-pattern-with-castle-windsor/">View Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

          <div class="post-content clearfix">
